# yuri

simple, sweet, and quick library/daemon for handling cryptocurrency payments in go

NOTE: this is extremely experimental

currently supports:
[x] Ethereum (+ERC20+ERC721)
[x] Litecoin
[x] Bitcoin
[x] Monero
[x] Solana (+tokens+SPL NFTs)
[X] Ton (+NFTs)

developers: examples [here](./example_test.go) or on `go doc`
end users: the daemon lives in [./cmd/yurid](./cmd/yurid)

licensed under the [AGPLv3](./LICENSE)
